bun exact.mjs update [--with <platforms>] [--without <platform>]
  after exact2 moves: rewrite exact.mjs, patches, toolchain and exact2 paths

  --with <platforms>    name native platforms in app.json (ios, mac, linux, android, windows), as their verbs do on first use; repeatable
  --without <platform>  stop shipping a platform: its app.json keys go; in an app that authored its crates, linux or android also lose their crate, workspace member and lock entries

Also rewrites AGENTS.md's generated block and adds the use lines the app's files lack;
app.json commands and your files are kept. EXACT=<path> names another Exact checkout.
An app that authored no Cargo workspace has none to rewrite: its native workspace is
generated under .exact/ by the verb that builds it.
Ports    none. Runs to completion.
Example  bun exact.mjs update

